    "name": "WaveFunctions_Unit_Circle",
    "title": "WaveFunctions_Unit_Circle",
    "lookup_name": "WaveFunctions_Unit_Circle",
    "description": "A turning point, signed coordinate rods and a finite twelve-metre angle graph. A reachable angle slider pauses the source; run and replay distinguish the moving point from the kept graph. Supporting objects occupy separate viewing bays on level floor.",
