    "key_elements": [
      "All seven authored artifacts retained.",
      "Spawn (11,2); exit (11,26), both on level floor.",
      "Unit circle (18,10), yaw 180, centre height 1.6 m; gallery preset gives a 12 m two-turn graph and accessible controls.",
      "Supporting bridge (6,18) at quarter scale; oscillation curve (19,18); projection film (22,20).",
      "Student bay: hall-local (11,0,10), yaw 180, unit scale."
    ]
